#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:9
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:11
msgid ""
"**Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin (KPP)** is a PyTorch plugin designed for training and"
" evaluating quantum-native energy models and enhanced AI models on **Special"
" Purpose Quantum Computers (SPQC)**."
msgstr ""
"**Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin (KPP)** is a PyTorch plugin designed for training and"
" evaluating quantum-native energy models and enhanced AI models on **Special"
" Purpose Quantum Computers (SPQC)**."

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:13
msgid ""
"It offloads Boltzmann sampling to the **Coherent Ising Machine (CIM)** "
"through the **Kaiwu SDK**, while keeping all other computations, parameter "
"updates, autograd, data loading, in the standard **PyTorch** workflow."
msgstr ""
"It offloads Boltzmann sampling to the **Coherent Ising Machine (CIM)** "
"through the **Kaiwu SDK**, while keeping all other computations, parameter "
"updates, autograd, data loading, in the standard **PyTorch** workflow."

